<title>USA: Niagara Mohawk Q4 loss after special charge.</title>
<headline>Niagara Mohawk Q4 loss after special charge.</headline>
<dateline>SYRACUSE, N.Y. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.24   profit	 $0.13</p>
<p> Net loss		  25,808   profit	27,874</p>
<p> Oper revs		971,106		  966,478</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 144,365		  144,329</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.50   profit	 $1.44</p>
<p> Net profit	     110,390   profit     248,036</p>
<p> Oper revs	    3,990,653		3,917,338</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 144,350		  144,329</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) NOTE: Results for Q4 and full-year 1996 include an extraordinary charge of $103.6 million, pretax, for the write off of regulatory assets associated with the company's fossil and hydro business. On an after-tax basis this charge totaled $67.4 million, or $0.47 per share. Full name of company is Niagra Mohawk Power Corp</p>
